# The read must FAIL: Surelog reports the eight ILLEGAL lines in dut.sv --
# a bounded queue whose bound is negative (UH0731) or x (UH0740), a defparam
# naming no parameter (EL0555), and five procedural continuous assignment
# targets selected with a variable index (UH0758: assign, deassign, an
# array word, force and release).  The exact count pins it to those:
# constant and parameter queue bounds, a defparam of an existing parameter,
# a whole-variable assign/deassign and a constant-select force/release must
# stay silent.
logger -expect error "Surelog reported 0 fatal, 0 syntax and 8 other error" 1
read_sv -nonote -noinfo -nowarning dut.sv
